Z||000006||Butter||05-04-2001||04:16 PM||||FieroLisa,<BR>Why you oughta' shucked him down a little bit and found out what he be talkin' bout.  You see I r Hill Billy and sounds like he wus want'n to strike up a conversation.  Why I could thank a lotta thangs he's tryin' ta say when he told you that,<P>"yah i had me one of these but it had a 305 in it from the factory" <P>Fer instance I could thank a 5 rrr 6 thangs he's trin' ta say translated.<P>1. He once owned a Fiero with a 305 cid engine that looked factory.<BR>2. He once owned a Fiero with a 305 cid engine that his buddy's from the factory put in for him.<BR>3. He once owned a Fiero that had a stock 305 cid engine in it.<BR>4. He once owned a stock Fiero and had 3 or 5 engines put threw it cause he drove the tires off it.<BR>5. He once owned a stock Fiero and kept a .30 caliber with five cartriages in for protection.<BR>6. He once stole a stock Fiero and got 3 to 5 years for it.<P>Reckin' You oughta looked an smelled at em' real good when he told you that cus he coulda been drunk rrr jus lyin'.  Might have been he coulda jus been fishin' ta open up a new can o worms.  Some a us r dum  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> an some a us jus wont let on we no nut'n. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif">  U jus never No.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P><BR>||||reg||6
