Z||000009||Spektyr||05-05-2001||02:35 AM||||Gotta watch out for those hillbillies FieroLisa... the only thing they like more than a 'purdy face' is 'a purdy face onna woman dat can rebuild da heads on der beat-up Chevy pickup'.<P>You probably witnessed a botched attempt to initiate a mating ritual, a not too uncommon practice of <I>homo sapiens hillbillis</I>.<P>Seems you were lucky and missed the next stage, which usually involves either some grunt-like guffawing and drooling, or an invitation to go to a 'hoedown' with his ma and paw.<P>Hillbillys are difficult to domesticate.  Daily bathing is usually considered a sign of weakness among them.<P>------------------<BR>85 GT (to be modified...)<BR>--Um, no the paint isn't oxidized, that's the ultra-rare Whirlpool White textured finish... yeah.<BR>89 Lincoln Town Car (has Fiero Envy)<BR>--Hey!  Can I have an anti-sway bar too?||||reg||1
